# --- Ownership scoping (core-manifest.json / issue #327) ---
# The `format:check` gate is template-owned and distributed by `biffo core
# upgrade`, so it must not assert over paths the template does not own — else an
# instance's own docs/, infra/ or app formatting reds a gate it never chose
# (the #325 class). This mirrors the manifest: ignore the user-owned trees, then
# re-include the template-owned carve-outs. (`dir/*` ignores the children but
# not the dir itself, so a later `!dir/child` can re-include it — plain `dir/`
# cannot be un-ignored.)
apps/*
!apps/portal
services/*
!services/api
!services/_template
!services/_plugins
infra/
docs/
README.md
biffo.config.json
biffo.core.json
biffo.plugins.json
